Recommends: nemo
Description: disk space analyzer and secure file shredder
 Halo shows what is filling your disk as an interactive sunburst, with
 Outline, Biggest and Oldest lists, and lets you securely shred what you
 find, including the thumbnails, recent-file entries and Trash copies your
 desktop leaves behind.
 .
 Shredding uses the DoD 5220.22-M 3-pass method or a single random pass,
 verifies the final pass, and warns honestly about SSDs, copy-on-write
 filesystems, snapshots and sync folders.
 .
 Halo works entirely offline: no account, no tracking, no network access.
